    <abstract>
        <para>Database containing observations of invasive alien species in Denmark. This dataset is an extract of species observations from the nationwide portal &amp;#34;invasive-arter.dk&amp;#34;. Data are mainly collected by amateur nature enthusiasts. Data only consist of validated data. Validation is based on photos and videos, which have been made inaccessible during the transfer of data to arter.dk.</para>
    </abstract>
